OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after crash in Tesco
OL,4,Acar park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died a month after a crash
OL,7,Fin a supermarket car park.
OL,9,FTwo vehicles were involved in the
OL,10,Fcollision in the parking area under the
OL,11,FA13 at Tesco in Pitsea on 21 August at
OL,12,Fabout 10:30 BST, Essex Police said.
OL,14,FThe woman, a passenger in one of the
OL,15,Fvehicles, was taken to hospital but has
OL,16,Fsince died, the force added.
OL,18,FOfficers are appealing for information
OL,19,For dashcam footage. No arrests have
OL,20,Fbeen made.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
